{"id":"wb-7-1231","name":"宝庆府古城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"宝庆府城墙","text":"宝庆府城墙，位于中国湖南省邵阳市大祥区，现存庆丰门（北门）、临津门两座城门及北面1300米墙段，为湖南省保存较好的城墙之一。2002年5月，宝庆府城墙公布为湖南省文物保护单位；2013年，以“宝庆府古城墙”之名列入第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E5%BA%86%E5%BA%9C%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99","revisionId":86741362,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86741362","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8aadf3d24250e8306c6cb1db.jpg","title":"宝庆府古城墙_邵阳_(7).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%AE%9D%E5%BA%86%E5%BA%9C%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99_%E9%82%B5%E9%98%B3_(7).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/%E5%AE%9D%E5%BA%86%E5%BA%9C%E5%8F%A4%E5%9F%8E%E5%A2%99_%E9%82%B5%E9%98%B3_%287%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"FreeePedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Baoqing Wall Shaoyang","width":320,"height":240}}